WEBVTT

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.200
"The Hero Detective's in Front of Alpha"

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.080
"I'm going to Alpha to see Moriarty!!!"

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.660
"I'm at Alpha now!"

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.290
Moririn!

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.790
They say he's at Alpha.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.540
There he is.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.500
Moriarty...

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.250
Just three weeks until the
Shinjuku Ward Mayor elections.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.330
Recently support for the current mayor
has been increasing.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.870
"Mayor Sebastian Moran"

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:40.700
His election run against candidate
Mach Kuniyoshi will determine the future of...

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.290
Help me!

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.410
The editor-in-chief of <i>Spring Weekly</i>
is threatening me!

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.700
Tell me his weakness!

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.160
Please!

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.660
What's in it for me?

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.790
The one who ate the Chinese dumpling was...

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.080
...you!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.290
The case has been solved...

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:06.750
...so let's all have a dumpling party!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:13.370
"Chingyokuken Dumplings"

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.620
Chingyokuken's Dumplings,
beloved by the hero detective!

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.370
Idiot.

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.700
Who will do it?

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.540
You will!

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.040
Idiot!

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:30.200
"Teawater Seminar"

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.410
Life is an explosion!

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:30.200
Teawater Seminar!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.000
He's in all the commercials!

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.040
Moririn's super-popular!

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.200
Well, the rise in support for Mayor Moran

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.910
is clearly thanks to his hero detective son.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:44.700
To explain for those of you who don't know,

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:50.660
"Ward Mayor Election Heats Up"

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.410
James- <i>san</i> , Mayor Moran's son,

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:50.660
has been working as a detective lately!

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:56.000
He's solved many difficult cases,
and his new nickname is "The Hero Detective!"

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:01.580
And the reason we aren't getting
any cases over the last month is?

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.830
He may have taken our jobs.

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.250
Hey, guys.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:46.540
I can't handle them all.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:49.750
"Lots of Animals"

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:50.290
I just want to help out my dad.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.330
It's been so long, I'm sure he's happy.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.080
Okay.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.500
Sit. Paw.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.790
Sleep. Headstand!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.330
We can pick any of these we want?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.580
Yeah. If you see one you want,
I'd like you to take it for me.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.660
Hmm? What is this?

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:22.580
"Animals were murdered at the Kabukicho zoo?

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:26.700
Unforgivable! The killer must die, too!"

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.280
...it says.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.750
The client is... anonymous.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.620
The pay is 30,000 yen.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:32.540
Cheap!

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.910
Well, they're animals.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.080
Underwear thief! I'll take this one!

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.830
An animal killer?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.500
What the heck? I hope the bears are okay!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.450
A Kuma who's worried about bears, huh?
[ <i>kuma</i> : bear]

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:52.370
There's a lot of emotion
in the client's words, though.

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.750
And it's anonymous, too.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.500
Let's take that one, then.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:02.580
I thought you brought us jobs
because you were busy!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:05.080
I'll go, too!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.370
"Kabukicho Zoo Zookeeper"

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.620
An anonymous job request?

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:16.290
I'm happy to have the
hero detective here, though.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:19.830
The cause of death is under investigation, huh?

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:20.790
Yes.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:24.790
All the symptoms appeared
similar to food poisoning.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.750
Here's our first stop.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.290
Sherlock, you're popular!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.450
That was terrible!

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.580
You stink! Don't talk, stinky!

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.830
It's your fault, Sherlock!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.080
This is the second cage.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:14.660
Wolves!

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.200
Go, stinky.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.580
The last one's the pheasants, huh?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:44.080
The goat's eating it!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.160
Yes. That's right.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:51.370
I could smell bamboo peaches in each cage.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.000
Bamboo... What's that?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:56.290
A poisonous plant.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:07:00.080
But I didn't smell it at all
in the zookeepers areas.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:04.080
So maybe someone from the
outside poisoned their food.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:07.620
But you'd stand out a lot.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:13.080
"Come Feed the Animals!"

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.080
They probably did it then.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:16.160
The feeding time was recorded
on the video cameras, right?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.450
Yes. It's not high-resolution, but yes.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.750
The guy who handled the cameras is out today.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.120
I can bring you the data tonight.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.870
Huh? You don't have to do that.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:33.120
No. I want to help you, too.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:38.580
I've looked after some of those animals
since they were born, and now...

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.450
I can't forgive them!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.160
Thank you! We'll catch--

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:46.370
Stinky here will catch the guy.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:48.080
Stop that!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.330
Stinky will catch them.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:49.980
Hey!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.410
Thank you!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.410
"Kabukicho Zoo Parking Lot"

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.950
What is this?

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.450
The criminal is... you!

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.620
Idiot.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.290
What is this?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.290
Idiot.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.830
They're using the audio from my commercials.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.080
Shitty editing.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:18.750
"Avenge the animals!!"
"Get the monsters who did this!!!"
"Monsters, take back the sound!!"

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.040
"Monsters, take back the sound"?

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.750
What does that mean?

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.120
I get it.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.120
Huh? You figured it out?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:26.290
Investigate the Momotaros.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:31.040
The Momotaros? From the case
where the vocalist was killed?

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.250
Yeah.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.080
I think they broke up after that.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.330
You were a fan of theirs, right?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.330
I'm a fan of Bliking!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.160
They did appear together sometimes, though.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.450
A wolf, a pheasant, and a monkey.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:50.330
So that's why you remembered the Momotaros?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.120
But then what's the deal with these comments?

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:56.450
"They're the ones who killed us.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.950
Defeat the Monsters."

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.410
Which means they want revenge
on the hero detective

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.410
and other two who broke up the band.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.750
Something like that.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.410
Then what about this "take back the sound"?

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.160
Music, most likely.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.910
Huh? Then the dead animals and the video...

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:17.250
It was all done by the former
members of the Momotaros?

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.870
What's their motive?

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.700
Revenge against us?

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.750
Wow, look at all these
messages from Mycroft- <i>san</i> !

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.000
It's still just a possibility.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.870
Find out where the Momotaros are, now.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.750
I asked Lestrade- <i>san</i> .

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:49.500
Pheasant is currently in 7th Prison, for murder.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:53.660
Dog is out of jail and at his
family's factory, where he works.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:57.120
And Monkey is studying language in New York.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.290
I checked his blog, so I'm sure.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:01.120
What prison was Dog in?

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.250
Um, 7th--

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.750
7th Prison...

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:12.500
Another criminal from 7th Prison...

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:16.040
Go check Dog's alibi.

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.000
"Mah-jong"

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.370
And that's my scoop on the Ward Mayor.

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.330
Interesting.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.570
"Dog's House - Inufuki Manufacturing"

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.330
He's wearing it.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.250
Sorry I'm late!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.950
This is the data you asked for.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:55.540
Thanks. I'll look into it right away.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:00.910
It was Dog inside. I checked.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:04.200
And he was working all night
on the night of the murders.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.910
I got testimony from his co-workers,
so we can be sure.

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.790
What about the security cameras?

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.330
Nothing.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:13.330
And now an update

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.790
I see...

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:15.790
on the escape from Tokyo 7th prison.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:23.450
The repeated suicides of the
escapees is still a mystery.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:27.000
The police are investigating

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.000
Keep watching him. Just in case.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.250
Got it.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.250
the involvement of Albert Trevor,

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.290
the escapees' leader.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:35.000
Hey, Moriarty was in 7th prison, too, right?

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.370
What's this Albert guy's deal?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:42.500
Well, he was this weird guy
who ran things inside, I guess.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.080
Did something happen inside?

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.450
What do you mean?

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.000
Just had a feeling.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:58.750
You know, I caught the
underwear thief and I feel great!

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.000
Let's all drink!

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.950
You, too, Moriarty!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.120
I'm a minor!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.580
Sorry for coming at this hour.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:24.250
I wanted to ask something.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:29.790
Can we talk down at the station about this girl?

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:30.950
What happened?

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:35.370
Well... she was found dead.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.750
Moriarty- <i>san</i> !

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.500
One of the witnesses in your case died, right?

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.160
Can you tell us the details?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.250
You'd interacted with her, right?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.910
She was killed after she said goodbye to you.

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:57.830
The internet says you might be the killers!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:00.620
Are you?

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.410
Move!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.700
He pushed me! He just pushed me!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:06.120
Listen to me, everyone!

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.000
We just heard about this, too,
and we haven't processed it yet.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:12.870
But we'll catch the killer.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:16.870
So give us time! Please!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:22.330
This video is great! Check it out!

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.290
Sorry. I'm back.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.950
What happened with Dog?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:30.700
He was drinking at a bar all night.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.750
This is awful.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.870
"The Hero Detective
(+2 Others) Enjoy Misfortune."

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:41.620
So the killer's trying to
turn the public against us?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.700
How could they kill Osada- <i>san</i> for that?

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.370
Defeat the Monsters.

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:51.890
"This is them!!"
"Defeat the Monsters!!"

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.040
That's a link!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.500
That wasn't there yesterday!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.910
Click on it!

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.020
"Defeat the Monsters!!"

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:09.700
Kill! Kill!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:09.780
"Momotaros Comeback Concert

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:09.780
Defeat the Monsters

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.780
Tonight at 9:00

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:09.780
Shinjuku Sewers"

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.370
We need to be careful.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.540
We're the Monsters that killed
the Momotaros after all.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:25.010
"Shinjuku Sewers"

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.370
This place is creepy.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:15:00.500
Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.540
"The Monsters Hide Among You"

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.170
"The Monster Detectives
Who Broke Up Our Band For Fun!"

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.410
"Defeat the Monsters!!"

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:10.620
Here we go!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.470
"Defeat the Monsters!!"

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:17.060
"The Hero Detective Moriarty!"

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:17.060
"The Weirdo Rakugo 
Detective Sherlock Holmes!"

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:17.060
"Assistant Stinky!"

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:26.540
The ones who broke up the Momotaros are here!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.750
Get 'em!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:29.120
Get 'em.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.200
"Arrest The Monsters!!"

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.540
Everyone, calm down!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.370
Those are fakes!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.660
The real Pheasant is in jail,

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:49.250
and Dog has found a new role for himself!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:49.670
"Dog - Former 
Momotaros Guitarist"

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.540
Who's that guy?

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:52.580
Hell no!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:55.450
Shut up, stinky!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:57.580
Okay, start it.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:04.250
Good evening to the rude detective.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.330
This is...

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.450
It's the girl who was on TV all the time before!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.370
Irene!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.200
Why?

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:19.330
I'm here to introduce you to a Japanese
performer on the streets of New York!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:24.410
His name is Monkey Samurai!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:24.370
"Monkey - Former 
Momotaros Drummer"

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.370
I recognize that!

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.450
It's the Monkey Magic that Monkey always did!

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:32.750
Then the Monkey Samurai...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.040
...is Monkey from Momotaros?

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.000
Monkey!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.120
Monkey- <i>san</i> !

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.660
Then...

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.200
Who are they?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.410
Somebody tell me!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:51.330
So who's inside the masks, old man?

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:55.830
Why did they hate the detectives again?

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.450
'Cause they broke up the band, right?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:03.120
So it must be someone who loves the Momotaros.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.540
I get it! It's the old couple
that found the peach!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.370
You're so stupid.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.040
The criminals are...

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:13.200
Crazed fans of the Momotaros.

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:16.580
So what was the point of all this?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.660
They were planning on luring the detectives here

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.580
and stabbing them with those knives.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:36.080
How is a giant peach like a trio of detectives?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.370
I don't know, how?

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.000
They were just about to be sliced up.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:47.620
Now let's see your faces, murderers.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.290
G-Girls?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:03.080
Why did you kill her?

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:07.910
The Momotaros were everything to us.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:11.500
They were the one things that made
our worthless lives worth living!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.540
So...

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:17.450
We decided we'd get revenge for them!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:21.790
But it's the fault of Pheasant
for killing Momotaro, right?

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:23.370
Pheasant didn't do it!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.830
You're the one who killed Momotaro!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.620
No, no...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.200
It's your fault...

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:39.040
You ruined... everything!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:43.370
I'll never forgive you!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:51.700
Maybe it was just a fun
little mystery game for you...

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.910
But for us, you took away our reason to live!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:59.870
You stole everything...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.870
I'm sorry.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.910
What? Shut up.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.120
What's gotten into you, Sherlock.

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.000
Are you feeling sympathetic or something?

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.290
I don't understand...

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.910
But I just felt like it.

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.660
Kiko, Umi!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.120
This smell...

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.450
This way, Nao! Hurry!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.200
Sherlock!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:18.540
You're fast, you know?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.700
You're lucky...

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:32.790
You can still listen to Bliking.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.750
I haven't had the chance lately, though.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:45.580
We all used to go see those concerts--

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.580
Let's end this now.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.660
Nao Kaieda.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.120
Umi Sakaguchi.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.540
Kiko Takeda.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:06.120
Wait! Don't!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.120
802...

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.200
046...

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:09.200
3840!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:35.660
You've changed, Sherlock.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:44.910
This latest tragedy was caused by crazed fans...

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.540
James Moran- <i>san</i> attended
the funeral of the victims

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.120
and wept with their families.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:57.290
"Today we're meeting paired up with Bliking!!"

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:09.000
"The Dark Connection Between
Moran and Jack the Ripper"

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:11.040
My independent investigations
have revealed a potential connection

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:17.080
between Ward Mayor Moran and Jack the Ripper.

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:24.000
I'm on my way to get proof
and get what's in it for me!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.830
I want to know the truth, you know!

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:04.790
"The Curtain Rises on the Grand Guignol"

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:04.750
I'll make a massive flower bloom!

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:06.700
"Ranking the Fashion Sense of Kabukicho Celebs!"
"Today's Guest: Mrs. Hudson (Age 52)"
"The great mother of Kabukicho
in their first TV appearance!"
